<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Project PBL: Monitoring Suhu IoT - ESP32</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0f172a;
      --card-bg: #1e293b;
      --text: #f8fafc;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      --accent: #38bdf8;
      --border: #334155;
    }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    header {
      padding: 4rem 2rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(56,189,248,0.1) 0%, rgba(15,23,42,1) 100%);
    }
    .badge {
      background: rgba(56,189,248,0.2);
      color: var(--accent);
      padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem;
    }
    p.subtitle {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }
    .container {
      display: block;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }
    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
    .card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
    .card h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: var(--accent);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    ul {
      padding-left: 1.2rem;
      margin: 0;
    }
    li {
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .metric-box {
      background: #0f172a;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1rem;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 1rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .metric-val {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: var(--accent);
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      margin-top: 3rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <span class="badge">Project-Based Learning (PBL)</span>
    <h1>Sistem Monitoring Suhu & Kelembapan Real-Time</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Implementasi Node Mikrokontroler ESP32 dan Sensor DHT22 berbasis IoT untuk Pembacaan Parameter Lingkungan.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid">
      <!-- Deskripsi Sistem -->
      <div class="card">
        <h3> Deskripsi Project</h3>
        <p>Sistem ini dirancang untuk memantau suhu dan kelembapan secara kontinu. Mikrokontroler ESP32 membaca data dari sensor DHT22, kemudian mengirimkan data tersebut via jaringan Wi-Fi ke server/dashboard online.</p>
        
        <div class="metric-box">
          <div>Status Koneksi</div>
          <div class="metric-val">Wi-Fi Connected</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Spesifikasi Komponen -->
      <div class="card">
        <h3> Spesifikasi Hardware & Software</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Mikrokontroler:</strong> ESP32 NodeMCU (Wi-Fi + BLE)</li>
          <li><strong>Sensor:</strong> DHT22 / DHT11 (Suhu & Kelembapan)</li>
          <li><strong>Catu Daya:</strong> 5V DC via Micro-USB / Adapter</li>
          <li><strong>IDE:</strong> VS Code / PlatformIO / Arduino IDE</li>
          <li><strong>Protokol Data:</strong> MQTT / HTTP REST API</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Informasi Tim -->
      <div class="card">
        <h3> Tim Pengembang</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Ketua Tim:</strong> Azka Aisy (Hardware & Wiring)</li>
          <li><strong>Anggota 1:</strong> Anggota A (Firmware C/C++)</li>
          <li><strong>Anggota 2:</strong> Anggota B (Dashboard & Web UI)</li>
          <li><strong>Dosen Pembimbing:</strong> Pembimbing Utama, S.T., M.T.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>
    &copy; 2026 PBL Teknik Elektro & Mechatronics. All rights reserved.
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
